Package: eolas
Title: Client for the eolas.nz Statistical Data API
Version: 1.13.0
Authors@R: person("Virtus Solutions", email = "phil@virtus-solutions.io", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides convenient access to the eolas.nz REST API
    (<https://api.eolas.nz>), which serves 1,500+ official statistical and
    geospatial datasets from Stats NZ, OECD, RBNZ, LINZ, NZTA, and more.
    Source-specific functions (eolas_get_statsnz(), eolas_get_oecd(), etc.)
    return tidy data frames ready for analysis with ggplot2, dplyr, or your
    favourite tooling.
